1
00:00:07,665 --> 00:00:09,025
SAY NO TO PIRACY, SUPPORT ORIGINALS

2
00:01:37,105 --> 00:01:39,025
ADAPTED FROM THE EARLY SPRING ON JJWXC.NET
AUTHOR: GU NIANG BIE KU

3
00:01:43,385 --> 00:01:45,265
-Morning.
-Morning, Mr. Luan.

4
00:01:45,345 --> 00:01:47,425
Can I clean your office now?

5
00:01:47,985 --> 00:01:48,825
Yes.

6
00:01:52,705 --> 00:01:53,905
Shang Zhitao.

7
00:01:55,265 --> 00:01:57,145
Why didn't you send me
the meeting minutes of the business trip?

8
00:01:58,265 --> 00:01:59,465
If you have forgotten about it,

9
00:01:59,545 --> 00:02:01,305
then you can consider resigning today.

10
00:02:01,385 --> 00:02:02,625
I did send it to you.

11
00:02:03,225 --> 00:02:04,665
I finished everything that night,

12
00:02:04,745 --> 00:02:05,945
and I sent it to you and Lumi.

13
00:02:06,025 --> 00:02:07,865
Where did you send it?
I didn't receive anything.

14
00:02:07,945 --> 00:02:09,065
Your e-mail.

15
00:02:09,744 --> 00:02:11,425
I did send it.

16
00:02:14,625 --> 00:02:15,865
There's another Luke in the company.

17
00:02:16,625 --> 00:02:17,865
Are you aware of that?

18
00:02:18,985 --> 00:02:20,665
Luke Liu.

19
00:02:21,265 --> 00:02:22,265
Check your mailbox.

20
00:02:22,865 --> 00:02:24,825
If you sent it to the wrong recipient,
that would be a breach of confidentiality.

21
00:02:24,905 --> 00:02:25,985
That's worse than forgetting to send it.

22
00:02:30,265 --> 00:02:31,265
Now, make sure

23
00:02:31,345 --> 00:02:33,225
to send your resignation letter
to the right address.

24
00:02:38,545 --> 00:02:40,945
Luke Liu?

25
00:02:45,025 --> 00:02:48,625
REPAYING FAVOR WITH YOUR LIFE

26
00:02:54,985 --> 00:02:56,905
-Flora.
-Lumi.

27
00:02:56,985 --> 00:02:58,465
The filming proposal has been approved.

28
00:02:58,545 --> 00:03:00,345
We'll head to the location tomorrow.

29
00:03:00,425 --> 00:03:01,385
But I checked the weather forecast,

30
00:03:01,465 --> 00:03:03,265
and it says there will be
a heavy rainstorm tomorrow.

31
00:03:03,905 --> 00:03:05,265
You know what? In a while,

32
00:03:05,345 --> 00:03:07,185
we'll discuss the filming
contingency plan with Luke.

33
00:03:07,265 --> 00:03:08,185
I…

34
00:03:08,265 --> 00:03:09,825
Can I still join?

35
00:03:09,905 --> 00:03:11,465
Of course.

36
00:03:11,545 --> 00:03:13,105
I've talked to Luke.

37
00:03:13,185 --> 00:03:14,625
You'll come with me.

38
00:03:17,505 --> 00:03:19,105
But I sent the e-mail to the wrong person.

39
00:03:19,185 --> 00:03:21,305
God knows if I can stay here or not.

40
00:03:22,185 --> 00:03:23,185
Listen.

41
00:03:23,745 --> 00:03:26,465
Just do two things well.

42
00:03:26,545 --> 00:03:29,145
Firstly, do what you need to do.

43
00:03:29,225 --> 00:03:30,545
Ace the filming of this commercial.

44
00:03:31,145 --> 00:03:31,985
Secondly,

45
00:03:32,785 --> 00:03:34,865
forget what Luke said.

46
00:03:36,305 --> 00:03:38,385
So I won't be fired?

47
00:03:38,465 --> 00:03:40,305
You won't.

48
00:03:40,385 --> 00:03:42,505
If they fire you,
who is going to work for me?

49
00:03:42,585 --> 00:03:44,905
Besides, we're having
the filming tomorrow.

50
00:03:44,985 --> 00:03:47,225
It's too late to onboard a new person.

51
00:03:47,305 --> 00:03:48,905
Don't worry.

52
00:03:48,985 --> 00:03:51,265
I'll help you stay.

53
00:03:52,585 --> 00:03:54,065
-Thank you, Lumi.
-Sure.

54
00:04:04,425 --> 00:04:05,425
You work at Lime now?

55
00:04:07,225 --> 00:04:08,225
But

56
00:04:08,945 --> 00:04:10,545
I don't know if I'll pass the probation.

57
00:04:10,625 --> 00:04:11,785
Thank you.

58
00:04:12,745 --> 00:04:13,745
Getting into Lime

59
00:04:13,825 --> 00:04:15,505
already gives you bragging rights
at your alma mater.

60
00:04:16,504 --> 00:04:18,145
To survive in Beijing,

61
00:04:18,225 --> 00:04:19,425
you have to go through trial and error.

62
00:04:19,944 --> 00:04:21,785
If you fail, you pay for the lesson.

63
00:04:21,865 --> 00:04:25,185
If you succeed, celebrate it. Drink it.

64
00:04:27,225 --> 00:04:30,225
Oh. How's your boyfriend, Xin Zhaozhou?

65
00:04:30,305 --> 00:04:31,385
Where is he working?

66
00:04:34,105 --> 00:04:37,185
We broke up before graduation.

67
00:04:37,905 --> 00:04:40,465
His mom wanted him
to apply to be a civil servant.

68
00:04:40,545 --> 00:04:44,065
He asked me to move with him,
but I said no.

69
00:04:44,145 --> 00:04:45,665
He could travel.

70
00:04:45,745 --> 00:04:47,425
Why couldn't he move to Beijing?

71
00:04:49,225 --> 00:04:50,985
That's just life, I guess.

72
00:04:51,065 --> 00:04:53,145
He wants to stay in the south.
I want to stay in the north.

73
00:04:53,905 --> 00:04:55,185
We don't have a choice.

74
00:04:56,905 --> 00:04:57,785
It's okay.

75
00:04:57,865 --> 00:05:01,025
Lime has the classiest men
in all of Beijing.

76
00:05:01,985 --> 00:05:03,345
Have a few relationships.

77
00:05:03,425 --> 00:05:05,385
Experience them while you're young.

78
00:05:11,865 --> 00:05:12,865
It's my boss.

79
00:05:12,945 --> 00:05:14,105
I have to take this.

80
00:05:17,865 --> 00:05:19,025
Hi. This is the dessert to go.

81
00:05:19,105 --> 00:05:20,785
-Thank you.
-You're welcome.

82
00:05:21,505 --> 00:05:24,105
I knew it. My client suddenly arrived.
I need to head back now.

83
00:05:24,865 --> 00:05:26,825
I packed two portions. Take them with you.

84
00:05:26,905 --> 00:05:27,985
You barely ate.

85
00:05:28,865 --> 00:05:31,225
Keep one for yourself.

86
00:05:32,385 --> 00:05:33,825
I only found out
that you had already footed the bill

87
00:05:33,905 --> 00:05:35,225
when I asked them to pack the food.

88
00:05:35,305 --> 00:05:37,345
But I told you it would be my treat.

89
00:05:37,425 --> 00:05:39,305
Buying me a meal
when you just found a job?

90
00:05:39,385 --> 00:05:40,425
Come on.

91
00:05:41,745 --> 00:05:42,905
Thanks.

92
00:05:45,305 --> 00:05:47,665
You have already outperformed

93
00:05:47,745 --> 00:05:51,105
95% of fresh graduates
by coming to Beijing alone.

94
00:05:51,185 --> 00:05:53,705
Tao, you can do this. Make sure you stay.

95
00:05:53,785 --> 00:05:56,745
When you're inside,
you always stand a chance.

96
00:05:57,345 --> 00:05:58,545
Don't worry.

97
00:05:58,625 --> 00:06:00,265
I will see it through.

98
00:06:14,945 --> 00:06:16,105
Lumi.

99
00:06:16,185 --> 00:06:18,385
Are you okay? Are you unwell?

100
00:06:19,505 --> 00:06:21,665
They can't confirm
the filming site with me.

101
00:06:22,305 --> 00:06:23,625
It's annoying.

102
00:06:23,705 --> 00:06:26,185
Plus, I'm on my period. My tummy hurts.

103
00:06:26,265 --> 00:06:27,345
Come.

104
00:06:27,985 --> 00:06:30,225
Drink this. I brought goji berry brew.

105
00:06:30,305 --> 00:06:32,105
Have some. While it's hot.

106
00:06:32,185 --> 00:06:34,145
When push comes to shove,
we'll stop somewhere.

107
00:06:34,225 --> 00:06:36,105
Take a break. Don't act tough.

108
00:06:36,185 --> 00:06:38,105
It's fine. I can endure this.

109
00:06:38,185 --> 00:06:39,905
We need to set everything up early.

110
00:06:39,985 --> 00:06:41,705
Luke might drop by at night.

111
00:06:41,785 --> 00:06:42,705
He…

112
00:06:42,785 --> 00:06:45,265
He's coming?

113
00:06:49,225 --> 00:06:51,265
Don't be so anxious.

114
00:06:51,345 --> 00:06:53,225
He just has high standards.

115
00:06:53,305 --> 00:06:55,025
He sounds mean, but he isn't.

116
00:06:55,105 --> 00:06:56,185
You'll see why working with him

117
00:06:56,265 --> 00:06:58,465
is a good thing as time goes by.

118
00:06:59,265 --> 00:07:02,585
Luke is not the hypocritical sort.

119
00:07:09,425 --> 00:07:10,265
Thank you.

120
00:07:18,385 --> 00:07:19,225
TAOBAO

121
00:07:19,305 --> 00:07:20,225
Look.

122
00:07:30,145 --> 00:07:31,945
Don't tell me

123
00:07:32,025 --> 00:07:34,425
-you brought your own bedding.
-I did.

124
00:07:34,505 --> 00:07:37,665
I expected a basic living condition,
given that it's a village,

125
00:07:37,745 --> 00:07:39,665
but I didn't expect it to be this bad.

126
00:07:40,265 --> 00:07:41,825
You're provident.

127
00:07:41,905 --> 00:07:43,385
I'm impressed.

128
00:07:43,465 --> 00:07:45,185
You have a bright future ahead of you.

129
00:07:45,265 --> 00:07:47,585
-Can I have this?
-Take it.

130
00:07:57,985 --> 00:07:58,825
Lumi,

131
00:07:58,905 --> 00:08:00,545
I'll check the next village

132
00:08:00,625 --> 00:08:02,545
to see if they have hot water.
I'll bring some to you.

133
00:08:02,625 --> 00:08:04,105
Don't make your bed. Just lie down.

134
00:08:04,185 --> 00:08:05,225
I'll help you later.

135
00:08:27,705 --> 00:08:29,065
Mr. Liu.

136
00:08:29,145 --> 00:08:31,345
Cancel today's itinerary. Just go back.

137
00:08:35,865 --> 00:08:36,904
Lumi.

138
00:08:36,985 --> 00:08:39,425
I got you two bottles of hot water.

139
00:08:40,105 --> 00:08:41,105
I was thinking

140
00:08:41,185 --> 00:08:42,784
I'll prepare cup noodles for you.

141
00:08:42,865 --> 00:08:44,144
Okay? You can eat something.

142
00:08:44,225 --> 00:08:45,585
Are you serious?

143
00:08:47,625 --> 00:08:51,025
I think you just saved my life.

144
00:09:05,585 --> 00:09:06,625
The bag!

145
00:09:08,585 --> 00:09:10,185
Mister. Quick.

146
00:09:10,265 --> 00:09:11,985
To the filming site. Now.

147
00:09:16,585 --> 00:09:18,545
‎-Coming through.
‎-Over here.

148
00:09:18,625 --> 00:09:20,505
We need to confirm the time with him.

149
00:09:20,585 --> 00:09:21,985
It's mainly because of the weather.

150
00:09:22,065 --> 00:09:23,665
I checked the weather forecast.

151
00:09:23,745 --> 00:09:25,785
It says it won't rain,
but it's cloudy now.

152
00:09:44,385 --> 00:09:45,625
We'll start shooting
when the actors are here.

153
00:09:45,705 --> 00:09:47,065
-Okay.
-Lumi.

154
00:09:47,145 --> 00:09:49,025
Tracy sent me over to help out.

155
00:09:49,105 --> 00:09:51,105
I'm Kitty, from Division Three.

156
00:09:54,585 --> 00:09:56,105
Kitty, is it?

157
00:09:56,185 --> 00:09:57,705
The Excel sheet
is in the shared OA system.

158
00:09:57,785 --> 00:09:58,625
-Okay.
-Take a look.

159
00:09:58,705 --> 00:10:00,305
We'll have a meeting
with the director later

160
00:10:00,385 --> 00:10:02,345
-to confirm the plan before we shoot.
-Okay.

161
00:10:02,425 --> 00:10:03,705
This is Shang Zhitao from my division.

162
00:10:04,985 --> 00:10:06,065
Hello.

163
00:10:08,785 --> 00:10:09,745
Still unwell?

164
00:10:10,265 --> 00:10:11,265
Let's go to the hospital.

165
00:10:11,345 --> 00:10:12,825
It's fine. I just need to sit for a while.

166
00:10:12,905 --> 00:10:14,745
Show this to her. Bring her up to date.

167
00:10:15,625 --> 00:10:17,545
Kitty., hold the fort here.

168
00:10:17,625 --> 00:10:19,145
I'll take Lumi back first.

169
00:10:19,225 --> 00:10:20,305
And take a look at this.

170
00:10:20,385 --> 00:10:21,225
-Okay.
-Thank you.

171
00:10:22,025 --> 00:10:23,945
Come. I'm done.

172
00:10:24,025 --> 00:10:25,225
Let's go to the hospital.
Stop acting tough.

173
00:10:25,305 --> 00:10:26,265
-I'm fine.
-Come.

174
00:10:26,345 --> 00:10:27,425
I…

175
00:10:27,505 --> 00:10:28,425
Call me if anything comes up.

176
00:10:28,505 --> 00:10:29,425
Okay.

177
00:10:33,865 --> 00:10:35,865
Did someone corner you at home again?

178
00:10:39,785 --> 00:10:41,265
It must be Zhang Xin.

179
00:10:41,345 --> 00:10:42,505
She came to my shop once.

180
00:10:42,585 --> 00:10:45,105
I said you and I were no longer friends
and asked her to leave.

181
00:10:45,745 --> 00:10:47,585
How does she know where I live?

182
00:10:48,265 --> 00:10:50,185
I'm not surprised.

183
00:10:50,265 --> 00:10:52,545
Women become Sherlock Holmes
when they are obsessed with you.

184
00:10:52,625 --> 00:10:53,825
It's easy to find where you live.

185
00:10:54,505 --> 00:10:56,305
You should head to your parents' mansion

186
00:10:56,385 --> 00:10:58,505
in the suburb and hide there.

187
00:10:58,585 --> 00:10:59,625
We'll see.

188
00:10:59,705 --> 00:11:02,505
I have to head to the filming site
and take a walk there.

189
00:11:03,025 --> 00:11:05,305
-I'll take your car.
-Go ahead. Drive safe.

190
00:11:06,745 --> 00:11:09,305
No wonder you're rich.

191
00:11:09,385 --> 00:11:10,825
You can earn money
while running away from a girl.

192
00:11:12,105 --> 00:11:12,985
Drive safe.

193
00:11:14,225 --> 00:11:16,585
Guys, we have to make it quick today.
Finish it while the sun is up.

194
00:11:16,665 --> 00:11:17,745
It'll rain soon.

195
00:11:17,825 --> 00:11:18,745
Yes, Mr. Director.

196
00:11:18,825 --> 00:11:19,905
Attention!

197
00:11:19,985 --> 00:11:21,265
Wrap it up while the sun is up!

198
00:11:21,345 --> 00:11:22,505
Kitty.

199
00:11:22,585 --> 00:11:24,905
I thought we were supposed
to have the meeting when I came back.

200
00:11:24,985 --> 00:11:26,185
Time is running out.

201
00:11:26,265 --> 00:11:27,545
The director said
it'd rain in the afternoon,

202
00:11:27,625 --> 00:11:29,265
so I had them start earlier.

203
00:11:32,225 --> 00:11:33,305
You must be new.

204
00:11:33,385 --> 00:11:34,505
First time leading a project?

205
00:11:35,385 --> 00:11:36,905
-Yes.
-Oh.

206
00:11:37,425 --> 00:11:38,705
The director said

207
00:11:38,785 --> 00:11:40,145
there are some backup props
we haven't bought.

208
00:11:40,225 --> 00:11:43,305
The driver told me
you had been here before.

209
00:11:43,385 --> 00:11:44,905
I need to make some important calls.

210
00:11:44,985 --> 00:11:48,065
Can I bother you to buy those props?

211
00:11:49,625 --> 00:11:51,745
Sure.

212
00:11:51,825 --> 00:11:53,545
Hold the fort then.

213
00:11:53,625 --> 00:11:55,945
-Keep me updated in the group chat.
-I don't need you to tell me that.

214
00:12:00,265 --> 00:12:05,505
COSTUME DEPARTMENT

215
00:12:08,745 --> 00:12:11,825
Strong precipitation is expected
in the next few hours.

216
00:12:11,905 --> 00:12:13,985
Please take the necessary precautions.

217
00:12:17,665 --> 00:12:18,865
Kitty.

218
00:12:18,945 --> 00:12:20,305
-I bought the props.
-Good.

219
00:12:20,385 --> 00:12:22,185
The actor for the evening scene

220
00:12:22,265 --> 00:12:24,705
complained that our accommodation
was too bad. They refused to come here.

221
00:12:25,225 --> 00:12:27,705
Can you check if there are
better accommodations nearby?

222
00:12:28,385 --> 00:12:30,945
The accommodation is very bad.
I understand why they complain.

223
00:12:31,025 --> 00:12:32,225
Sure.

224
00:12:36,425 --> 00:12:39,105
Mister, how long till we get there?

225
00:12:39,185 --> 00:12:40,865
That village is quite remote.

226
00:12:40,945 --> 00:12:42,225
But worry not,

227
00:12:42,305 --> 00:12:43,625
it's exactly what you're looking for.

228
00:12:43,705 --> 00:12:45,865
If the room is decent,

229
00:12:45,945 --> 00:12:48,625
ask more villagers to spare us some rooms.

230
00:12:48,705 --> 00:12:49,985
With a beautiful lady
like you staying over,

231
00:12:50,065 --> 00:12:53,905
everyone will prepare their beds nicely
and warm them up for you.

232
00:13:07,265 --> 00:13:08,305
‎Hello, Mr. Luan.

233
00:13:08,385 --> 00:13:09,345
Hello, Mr. Luan.

234
00:13:11,985 --> 00:13:12,825
Hello, Mr. Luan.

235
00:13:13,345 --> 00:13:15,065
-Hello, Mr. Luan.
-Hello, Mr. Luan.

236
00:13:16,305 --> 00:13:17,865
Mr. Luan, what brought you here?

237
00:13:17,945 --> 00:13:19,465
Where are Lumi and Shang Zhitao?

238
00:13:20,745 --> 00:13:22,425
Lumi is sick.

239
00:13:22,505 --> 00:13:25,105
Flora went to find new accommodation.
She hasn't returned yet.

240
00:13:27,985 --> 00:13:30,545
The accommodation we found was quite bad.

241
00:13:30,625 --> 00:13:32,145
The actors don't want to stay there,

242
00:13:32,225 --> 00:13:33,665
and their car has broken down.

243
00:13:33,745 --> 00:13:35,105
The other cars
are at the foot of the mountain,

244
00:13:35,185 --> 00:13:38,865
so I asked a villager
to find new accommodation with Flora.

245
00:13:38,945 --> 00:13:40,385
Why didn't you go?

246
00:13:41,585 --> 00:13:42,865
We agreed on the work delegation.

247
00:13:42,945 --> 00:13:44,745
What makes you think
you can delegate work?

248
00:14:09,145 --> 00:14:12,905
Sorry. The user you called
cannot be reached.

249
00:14:12,985 --> 00:14:14,425
Please try again later.

250
00:14:18,025 --> 00:14:19,345
Stop the shoot. Be on standby.

251
00:14:19,425 --> 00:14:20,505
-Call the police. Find her.
-Shang Zhitao!

252
00:14:20,585 --> 00:14:21,545
Shang Zhitao!

253
00:14:22,625 --> 00:14:24,025
The girl looking for rooms
went to the mountain.

254
00:14:24,105 --> 00:14:26,425
The back mountain is full of steep slopes.
It might collapse anytime.

255
00:14:26,505 --> 00:14:27,905
There could also be rockfalls.

256
00:14:27,985 --> 00:14:29,265
You'll die if you go in.

257
00:14:31,625 --> 00:14:32,945
It's just right in front.

258
00:14:33,025 --> 00:14:35,385
Once we're in the village,
we'll find a shelter first.

259
00:14:35,465 --> 00:14:37,105
Once the rain stops,
I'll ride back with you.

260
00:14:44,185 --> 00:14:46,225
Mister. The rain is too heavy.

261
00:14:46,305 --> 00:14:48,105
Let's turn back. Just forget it.

262
00:14:48,185 --> 00:14:49,705
I have not seen this road before.

263
00:14:49,785 --> 00:14:51,625
This isn't how we came here.

264
00:14:51,705 --> 00:14:54,225
It's raining. This is a shortcut.

265
00:14:55,745 --> 00:14:57,145
The road condition is awful.

266
00:14:57,225 --> 00:14:58,585
Just cling to me.

267
00:14:59,105 --> 00:15:00,625
-Come. Come.
-Hey, you…

268
00:15:01,185 --> 00:15:02,385
Come.

269
00:16:41,145 --> 00:16:42,745
LANDSLIDE WARNING, NO ENTRY

270
00:18:39,985 --> 00:18:40,865
Luan Nian!

271
00:18:42,825 --> 00:18:43,825
Luan Nian!

272
00:18:49,465 --> 00:18:50,305
Luan Nian!

273
00:18:51,945 --> 00:18:53,905
Luan Nian! Luan Nian!

274
00:18:58,665 --> 00:18:59,545
It's dangerous here.

275
00:18:59,625 --> 00:19:00,785
Find a safe place first.

276
00:19:08,585 --> 00:19:09,705
Forget about me. Go now.

277
00:19:14,105 --> 00:19:15,065
Go now!

278
00:19:31,505 --> 00:19:32,385
Shang Zhitao.

279
00:19:57,905 --> 00:19:58,745
Are you okay?

280
00:20:00,225 --> 00:20:01,345
I just sprained my ankle.

281
00:20:01,425 --> 00:20:02,985
It hurts when I move.

282
00:20:08,185 --> 00:20:09,145
Your hand is bleeding.

283
00:20:13,905 --> 00:20:14,985
Hang in there.

284
00:20:15,745 --> 00:20:17,225
We should get out as soon as possible.

285
00:20:17,305 --> 00:20:18,425
There might be landslides.

286
00:20:25,465 --> 00:20:26,585
Put these on.

287
00:20:49,145 --> 00:20:50,225
Did I do it right?

288
00:20:51,185 --> 00:20:52,625
There are falling rocks.

289
00:20:55,345 --> 00:20:56,665
We have to take another route.

290
00:21:13,425 --> 00:21:15,665
Listen to my command later.
Do not thrash around.

291
00:21:16,905 --> 00:21:19,185
No matter what happens, do not let go.

292
00:21:41,305 --> 00:21:42,305
Hug me tightly.

293
00:22:06,985 --> 00:22:07,905
Slowly.

294
00:22:09,385 --> 00:22:10,625
Let's rest here.

295
00:22:12,985 --> 00:22:13,945
Are we safe now?

296
00:22:15,065 --> 00:22:16,025
For now, yes.

297
00:22:16,105 --> 00:22:19,265
There should be a village right in front.

298
00:22:25,665 --> 00:22:26,705
Sit down.

299
00:22:32,945 --> 00:22:33,945
How come you came?

300
00:22:37,465 --> 00:22:39,425
Venturing alone in this remote place?

301
00:22:40,345 --> 00:22:42,465
Must a rookie like you work
this hard even in this dire situation?

302
00:22:44,065 --> 00:22:45,865
No one could reach you,
so everyone came to find you.

303
00:22:47,505 --> 00:22:49,145
Fortunately, you are fine.

304
00:22:50,105 --> 00:22:50,945
Put this on.

305
00:23:00,145 --> 00:23:02,745
Sorry. I've troubled
the company once again.

306
00:23:14,585 --> 00:23:16,785
It might hurt a little. Bear with me.

307
00:23:43,145 --> 00:23:44,025
Thank you.

308
00:24:01,665 --> 00:24:03,825
Don't move. I'm more cautious
than you are.

309
00:24:03,905 --> 00:24:05,345
If you become a cripple,

310
00:24:05,865 --> 00:24:07,545
you can always come to work
in your wheelchair.

311
00:24:25,625 --> 00:24:27,025
You're injured.

312
00:24:27,105 --> 00:24:28,665
It's quite serious.

313
00:24:28,745 --> 00:24:29,585
I'm fine.

314
00:24:35,585 --> 00:24:37,665
We're in the same boat.

315
00:24:38,345 --> 00:24:39,345
Let me dress the wound for you.

316
00:24:56,065 --> 00:24:56,905
Sorry.

317
00:24:58,265 --> 00:24:59,105
I'm fine.

318
00:25:11,065 --> 00:25:11,905
Does it hurt?

319
00:26:00,065 --> 00:26:01,145
Get up.

320
00:26:10,745 --> 00:26:11,585
Take this.

321
00:26:17,185 --> 00:26:18,385
Come.

322
00:26:38,145 --> 00:26:41,665
When I was stuck inside,

323
00:26:41,745 --> 00:26:42,825
I felt hopeless.

324
00:26:43,385 --> 00:26:44,745
I thought

325
00:26:46,345 --> 00:26:50,105
that for my first project in Lime,
I would be on the social news.

326
00:26:52,185 --> 00:26:53,185
In my projects,

327
00:26:54,025 --> 00:26:55,865
only my client's ads
get to be on the news.

328
00:26:56,745 --> 00:26:57,665
Not my subordinates.

329
00:26:59,865 --> 00:27:01,145
I was also thinking

330
00:27:02,905 --> 00:27:07,065
that I would die, but I hadn't left
any last words for my parents.

331
00:27:09,585 --> 00:27:10,625
What would you have said?

332
00:27:12,025 --> 00:27:13,705
I…

333
00:27:13,785 --> 00:27:16,025
I would never have the chance
to repay their kindness.

334
00:27:16,105 --> 00:27:17,545
And back then, I was craving

335
00:27:17,625 --> 00:27:19,785
my dad's braised fish.

336
00:27:22,705 --> 00:27:24,705
You barely escaped,

337
00:27:24,785 --> 00:27:26,305
and you now want to kill a fish?

338
00:27:26,385 --> 00:27:27,865
But didn't they say

339
00:27:28,545 --> 00:27:30,305
eating fish makes you smarter?

340
00:27:30,385 --> 00:27:32,945
I want to be smart and stay at Lime

341
00:27:33,025 --> 00:27:34,185
to learn from you.

342
00:27:38,625 --> 00:27:39,945
How did you know

343
00:27:40,465 --> 00:27:41,905
to hit the corner
of the window to smash it open?

344
00:27:42,625 --> 00:27:45,745
I saw it on the news.
I didn't know it'd work.

345
00:27:48,185 --> 00:27:51,385
It seems like your brain
isn't as empty as I thought.

346
00:28:06,945 --> 00:28:08,545
‎-There they are.
‎-Over there.

347
00:28:08,625 --> 00:28:09,985
Luke! Shang Zhitao.

348
00:28:10,065 --> 00:28:11,585
They are there. We found them.

349
00:28:11,665 --> 00:28:12,625
-Over there!
-It's them!

350
00:28:12,705 --> 00:28:14,385
-That's them.
-Looks like they're hurt.

351
00:28:14,465 --> 00:28:15,305
‎Call 120.

352
00:28:15,385 --> 00:28:16,225
‎Get them to a hospital.

353
00:28:39,305 --> 00:28:43,065
HEALTH FIRST, EXPERT CARE

354
00:29:43,265 --> 00:29:44,105
Nurse,

355
00:29:44,945 --> 00:29:46,385
where is the guy on the bed?

356
00:29:46,465 --> 00:29:47,945
Passed out
due to an intracranial hemorrhage.

357
00:29:48,025 --> 00:29:49,145
He was just sent to a major hospital
for emergency treatment.

358
00:29:51,985 --> 00:29:52,825
He…

359
00:29:53,465 --> 00:29:55,665
But he was fine last night.

360
00:29:55,745 --> 00:29:56,865
Most acute damage only appears

361
00:29:56,945 --> 00:29:58,945
several hours
after the wound is inflicted.

362
00:29:59,025 --> 00:30:01,305
You won't notice it at the time,
and when you do, it's too late.

363
00:30:02,505 --> 00:30:04,025
Where is he? I have to find him.

364
00:30:04,105 --> 00:30:05,145
Wait.

365
00:30:06,025 --> 00:30:07,225
What's the hurry?

366
00:30:09,465 --> 00:30:11,945
Aren't you the one
being rushed to emergency?

367
00:30:13,305 --> 00:30:14,425
Can you not jinx me?

368
00:30:15,105 --> 00:30:15,985
It's the other patient.

369
00:30:21,825 --> 00:30:23,025
The filming is over.

370
00:30:23,545 --> 00:30:24,785
I'll send you back to Beijing later.

371
00:30:25,385 --> 00:30:26,665
I hope I didn't cause any delays.

372
00:30:27,665 --> 00:30:30,385
Now is not the time for this.

373
00:30:42,385 --> 00:30:43,345
Eat now.

374
00:31:00,065 --> 00:31:02,545
Flora. Let's reflect on your work.

375
00:31:03,265 --> 00:31:06,265
Do you think you handled
this project well?

376
00:31:07,385 --> 00:31:09,345
I shouldn't have acted on my own.

377
00:31:09,865 --> 00:31:11,385
I lacked danger awareness.

378
00:31:12,465 --> 00:31:13,865
I caused trouble for everyone.

379
00:31:15,505 --> 00:31:16,705
What about teamwork?

380
00:31:18,185 --> 00:31:19,025
It was good.

381
00:31:21,865 --> 00:31:23,585
You still haven't realized
the problem, have you?

382
00:31:24,665 --> 00:31:25,985
Is Kitty your boss?

383
00:31:27,945 --> 00:31:29,665
Lumi and you are my bosses.

384
00:31:29,745 --> 00:31:31,625
Kitty is just a senior.

385
00:31:33,705 --> 00:31:34,745
A senior.

386
00:31:35,585 --> 00:31:37,225
There are many seniors in the office.

387
00:31:37,745 --> 00:31:41,265
Can a senior staff member
boss you around in your project?

388
00:31:41,865 --> 00:31:43,825
What's the point
of your project lead then?

389
00:31:47,865 --> 00:31:50,585
Are you going to ask me
to resign again this time?

390
00:32:01,105 --> 00:32:03,105
Rest up. Take care of yourself.

391
00:32:03,785 --> 00:32:04,745
Make sure to go through
with the follow-up examination.

392
00:32:06,025 --> 00:32:08,145
If you feel unwell, go to Lumi

393
00:32:09,185 --> 00:32:10,105
or me.

394
00:32:14,145 --> 00:32:15,665
Thank you for the advice, Luke.

395
00:32:16,265 --> 00:32:17,905
I will follow your advice from now on.

396
00:32:45,025 --> 00:32:47,145
What kind of job is this?

397
00:32:47,225 --> 00:32:48,945
You are a cripple now.

398
00:32:49,505 --> 00:32:50,665
Come. Let me do it.

399
00:32:50,745 --> 00:32:52,185
Stop. Let me do it.

400
00:32:52,985 --> 00:32:54,465
Knowing your situation,

401
00:32:55,265 --> 00:32:57,385
you'll probably have to rest
at home for six months. Come.

402
00:32:58,505 --> 00:33:00,185
Make the company
support you for ten years.

403
00:33:00,945 --> 00:33:02,665
The doctor said

404
00:33:02,745 --> 00:33:04,785
-my bone wasn't affected.
-Careful.

405
00:33:04,865 --> 00:33:08,145
Besides, Luan Nian got injured
while rescuing me as well.

406
00:33:08,825 --> 00:33:11,065
Now is not the time to be selfless.

407
00:33:12,425 --> 00:33:13,705
They are two different things.

408
00:33:13,785 --> 00:33:15,385
You got injured during work,

409
00:33:15,465 --> 00:33:16,305
so the company
must take full responsibility.

410
00:33:23,265 --> 00:33:25,025
As for Luan Nian…

411
00:33:25,105 --> 00:33:26,505
For saving your life,

412
00:33:27,105 --> 00:33:28,225
devote yourself to him.

413
00:33:28,745 --> 00:33:29,625
Then, you're even.

414
00:33:29,705 --> 00:33:31,905
-How sweet.
-Your job habit is coming out.

415
00:33:34,225 --> 00:33:35,185
No.

416
00:33:35,825 --> 00:33:37,985
He is a bad person.

417
00:33:38,065 --> 00:33:39,745
He gave you a hard time.

418
00:33:39,825 --> 00:33:40,825
He asked you to resign.

419
00:33:40,905 --> 00:33:41,865
That's workplace bullying.

420
00:33:41,945 --> 00:33:43,665
No. He's a bad person.

421
00:33:43,745 --> 00:33:45,465
How can our Tao fall for him?

422
00:33:45,545 --> 00:33:46,825
No. Not at all.

423
00:33:46,905 --> 00:33:48,065
You misunderstood.

424
00:33:48,145 --> 00:33:49,705
He is

425
00:33:50,305 --> 00:33:52,585
cold-faced and sharp-tongued,
but kind on the inside.

426
00:33:52,665 --> 00:33:55,625
Look. He cares
about his subordinates' safety.

427
00:33:56,665 --> 00:33:58,545
And he teaches me many things.

428
00:33:58,625 --> 00:34:01,065
I think I might have
misjudged him previously.

429
00:34:01,145 --> 00:34:02,545
-He…
-Shang Zhitao.

430
00:34:03,545 --> 00:34:05,265
Did you notice that?

431
00:34:07,745 --> 00:34:08,824
I…

432
00:34:08,905 --> 00:34:09,985
Notice what?

433
00:34:10,065 --> 00:34:13,065
You're defending him.

434
00:34:13,865 --> 00:34:15,425
You're praising him.

435
00:34:22,545 --> 00:34:24,985
I'm just being objective, okay?

436
00:34:26,225 --> 00:34:27,264
Objective, right.

437
00:34:27,865 --> 00:34:30,025
He came to my rescue alone.

438
00:34:30,545 --> 00:34:32,065
Anyone would be moved by that.

439
00:34:32,145 --> 00:34:33,784
Yes, he came to your rescue alone.

440
00:34:33,865 --> 00:34:35,225
You two saved each other.

441
00:34:35,304 --> 00:34:36,985
I am so moved by it.

442
00:34:38,185 --> 00:34:39,185
Shang Zhitao.

443
00:34:39,945 --> 00:34:41,585
Listen.

444
00:34:41,665 --> 00:34:44,025
Be brave when you have to.

445
00:34:44,105 --> 00:34:47,225
Don't miss out on the perfect guy
you ran into with your life.

446
00:34:54,225 --> 00:34:55,705
Why isn't Zhu back yet?

447
00:34:55,784 --> 00:34:58,025
Didn't he mention
he'd make pork rib soup today?

448
00:34:58,105 --> 00:35:00,625
Oh, my mom even bought
the Harbin red sausages

449
00:35:00,705 --> 00:35:02,345
that you like.

450
00:35:02,425 --> 00:35:03,425
-Changing the topic?
-We…

451
00:35:03,505 --> 00:35:04,865
Okay. I get it.

452
00:35:04,945 --> 00:35:06,305
Let me call Zhu now

453
00:35:06,385 --> 00:35:07,825
so that he'll come back
to boil the pork rib soup

454
00:35:07,905 --> 00:35:08,945
and give you the nutrients you need.

455
00:35:27,785 --> 00:35:29,025
Anything you want to add?

456
00:35:29,105 --> 00:35:30,025
-That's all.
-Nothing.

457
00:35:30,105 --> 00:35:32,025
-That's all.
-Sign the contract then.

458
00:35:32,545 --> 00:35:34,185
-Okay.
-That's all.

459
00:35:34,265 --> 00:35:35,105
Dismissed.

460
00:35:36,825 --> 00:35:38,185
I'm heading to Finance.

461
00:36:06,505 --> 00:36:07,745
Colin, bring my laptop over.

462
00:36:07,825 --> 00:36:09,025
Luan Nian.

463
00:36:11,025 --> 00:36:13,985
I heard someone
almost died in your project.

464
00:36:14,505 --> 00:36:15,425
That is scary.

465
00:36:16,225 --> 00:36:18,345
I hope the client
didn't give you a hard time.

466
00:36:18,425 --> 00:36:20,265
Projects always come with risks.

467
00:36:21,025 --> 00:36:22,825
After all, not everyone can rely on luck

468
00:36:22,905 --> 00:36:26,065
and copy someone else's idea as you do.

469
00:36:26,145 --> 00:36:29,145
Ideas are meant to bounce off each other.

470
00:36:30,065 --> 00:36:31,425
The difference
between inspiration and plagiarism

471
00:36:31,505 --> 00:36:34,345
is similar to the difference
between a professional and you.

472
00:36:35,185 --> 00:36:36,385
How is it?

473
00:36:36,465 --> 00:36:38,585
Did you enjoy cleaning up the huge mess
you snatched from me?

474
00:36:39,265 --> 00:36:41,585
That's one of Lime's biggest clients.

475
00:36:42,905 --> 00:36:44,345
Of course, it is.

476
00:36:44,425 --> 00:36:46,105
But somehow, when you manage it,

477
00:36:46,625 --> 00:36:48,705
half of the client's budget is axed,

478
00:36:48,785 --> 00:36:50,585
and you had to work overtime
to fix the presentation deck.

479
00:36:51,345 --> 00:36:52,465
How's your sleep?

480
00:36:52,545 --> 00:36:54,025
Your eye bags
are about to fall on the floor.

481
00:36:57,905 --> 00:36:59,545
Don't you have work to do?

482
00:37:09,985 --> 00:37:10,825
Flora.

483
00:37:11,345 --> 00:37:12,345
Lumi.

484
00:37:12,425 --> 00:37:13,985
Why did you come to work?

485
00:37:14,065 --> 00:37:15,505
You can barely walk.

486
00:37:15,585 --> 00:37:16,665
It's fine. I went to get
my follow-up examination.

487
00:37:16,745 --> 00:37:18,305
The doctor said
I just needed to rest for two days.

488
00:37:18,385 --> 00:37:19,265
I forgot to take my laptop,

489
00:37:19,345 --> 00:37:21,145
so I came to check on everything.

490
00:37:21,825 --> 00:37:23,705
This is a work injury.

491
00:37:24,585 --> 00:37:26,385
Lime will not exploit you.

492
00:37:26,465 --> 00:37:28,025
They even bought insurance for you.

493
00:37:28,105 --> 00:37:30,145
Just stay at home and rest up.

494
00:37:30,865 --> 00:37:31,865
Go back.

495
00:37:33,345 --> 00:37:37,145
Actually, I want to thank Luke.

496
00:37:38,225 --> 00:37:39,465
Of course.

497
00:37:39,545 --> 00:37:41,305
But don't buy him any gifts.

498
00:37:41,385 --> 00:37:43,065
You can buy him a meal.

499
00:37:44,225 --> 00:37:45,065
I'll think about it.

500
00:37:45,145 --> 00:37:46,425
Yes!

501
00:37:46,505 --> 00:37:47,825
A new record.

502
00:37:47,905 --> 00:37:49,665
We got it. We are just too amazing.

503
00:37:50,745 --> 00:37:52,025
What a stellar result.

504
00:38:05,985 --> 00:38:07,905
I need to share something with you.

505
00:38:08,945 --> 00:38:09,865
I just got news

506
00:38:09,945 --> 00:38:13,745
that our team
secured the Mulanshuo project

507
00:38:13,825 --> 00:38:15,345
for annual advertising.

508
00:38:20,945 --> 00:38:23,985
Thank you for your hard work
the past three months.

509
00:38:24,505 --> 00:38:28,065
But as usual, we'll celebrate later.

510
00:38:28,665 --> 00:38:30,385
We still have work to finish.

511
00:38:30,465 --> 00:38:32,785
Make sure the online operations
go smoothly this week.

512
00:38:33,385 --> 00:38:37,385
We'll gather here every morning
at 8:00 a.m. for a daily briefing report.

513
00:38:37,465 --> 00:38:39,225
-Okay?
-Sure.

514
00:38:41,065 --> 00:38:42,225
‎Give it a quick touch-up.

515
00:38:46,385 --> 00:38:49,065
While everyone's here today,
let's have a recap of the project.

516
00:38:50,985 --> 00:38:52,905
As you all know,
a major incident took place

517
00:38:53,865 --> 00:38:54,905
during the day of filming.

518
00:38:57,825 --> 00:38:58,705
Mr. Luan,

519
00:38:58,785 --> 00:39:01,865
I meant to find
an opportunity to explain to you.

520
00:39:01,945 --> 00:39:03,345
I wasn't shirking my duty that day.

521
00:39:03,425 --> 00:39:05,025
The script was changed last minute,

522
00:39:05,105 --> 00:39:07,105
so I needed
to discuss it with the director.

523
00:39:07,185 --> 00:39:09,265
I was busy, so I asked Flora to help me.

524
00:39:10,065 --> 00:39:12,185
I'll make sure
to keep this in mind moving forward.

525
00:39:12,985 --> 00:39:14,865
So what's the point
of sending you over to assist?

526
00:39:15,465 --> 00:39:16,305
I…

527
00:39:16,985 --> 00:39:19,985
I didn't know Shang Zhitao was new here.

528
00:39:20,065 --> 00:39:21,745
I thought she could handle it.

529
00:39:21,825 --> 00:39:24,545
And everyone said
that she knew that place very well,

530
00:39:24,625 --> 00:39:25,865
so I let her handle it.

531
00:39:26,585 --> 00:39:27,705
Who is everyone?

532
00:39:32,705 --> 00:39:35,745
My management style is quite simple.
Regardless of your experience,

533
00:39:35,825 --> 00:39:37,945
those who won't take responsibility
will be replaced

534
00:39:38,025 --> 00:39:39,905
by those who will.

535
00:39:41,905 --> 00:39:43,705
Flora is new.

536
00:39:43,785 --> 00:39:45,505
She wanted to prove herself

537
00:39:45,585 --> 00:39:46,425
and was eager to take on tasks.

538
00:39:46,505 --> 00:39:47,665
-I can't stop her.
-Kitty.

539
00:39:48,905 --> 00:39:51,265
You have not been promoted
for three years.

540
00:39:51,345 --> 00:39:53,585
I understand that you see
the new hire as a threat,

541
00:39:54,585 --> 00:39:56,665
but that doesn't mean you should lie.

542
00:39:57,185 --> 00:40:01,145
Shang Zhitao invited the director
over from Guangzhou herself.

543
00:40:01,665 --> 00:40:04,825
What do you mean she needed you
to manage the director?

544
00:40:08,945 --> 00:40:10,225
What's done is done.

545
00:40:10,305 --> 00:40:12,065
Now, we need to solve the problem.

546
00:40:12,945 --> 00:40:14,065
This time, everyone
on the management level,

547
00:40:14,145 --> 00:40:15,385
including me, has to take accountability.

548
00:40:15,465 --> 00:40:17,345
One, it was our oversight.

549
00:40:17,425 --> 00:40:18,305
Two,

550
00:40:19,545 --> 00:40:21,265
we did not train
our new employee adequately.

551
00:40:22,425 --> 00:40:25,505
Lime will punish all relevant personnel,

552
00:40:25,585 --> 00:40:26,985
including me.

553
00:40:38,785 --> 00:40:42,105
Lumi's report yesterday
mentioned Flora specifically.

554
00:40:42,745 --> 00:40:44,625
I plan to confirm her position.

555
00:40:44,705 --> 00:40:46,065
Are you okay with it?

556
00:40:46,145 --> 00:40:48,585
You have the final say.
I can never say no.

557
00:40:49,985 --> 00:40:52,225
And I thought you finally
acknowledged her capabilities

558
00:40:52,305 --> 00:40:53,945
and my taste.

559
00:40:54,705 --> 00:40:57,305
You sure have a peculiar taste.

560
00:40:58,465 --> 00:41:00,905
So, I'll proceed then.

561
00:41:04,585 --> 00:41:05,625
Look at this.

562
00:41:09,185 --> 00:41:11,145
LIME ADVERTISING EMPLOYMENT CONTRACT

563
00:41:11,225 --> 00:41:13,065
EMPLOYEE: SHANG ZHITAO

564
00:41:13,665 --> 00:41:15,305
Employment contract?

565
00:41:15,865 --> 00:41:18,945
Your performance
in your first position was impressive.

566
00:41:19,025 --> 00:41:20,385
I have talked to Luke.

567
00:41:20,465 --> 00:41:22,985
He agreed to let you stay
at Business Division One.

568
00:41:23,065 --> 00:41:24,265
Do you want the position?

569
00:41:26,305 --> 00:41:27,425
Yes.

570
00:41:28,025 --> 00:41:29,025
Then, sign the contract.

571
00:41:30,345 --> 00:41:31,465
Thank you, Tracy.

572
00:41:31,545 --> 00:41:32,505
No need to thank me.

573
00:41:32,585 --> 00:41:35,785
Everyone saw how diligent
and responsible you are.

574
00:41:36,305 --> 00:41:38,305
You earned the contract yourself.

575
00:41:38,385 --> 00:41:39,465
Keep it up.

576
00:41:40,225 --> 00:41:42,385
I… I'll continue to work hard.

577
00:41:43,065 --> 00:41:46,545
Beijing is harsh but fair.

578
00:41:46,625 --> 00:41:48,225
But in Lime,

579
00:41:48,305 --> 00:41:50,545
if you work hard,
you will get something back.

580
00:42:06,505 --> 00:42:08,665
Do you have time?

581
00:42:08,745 --> 00:42:12,185
I would like
to buy you a meal to thank you.

582
00:42:15,785 --> 00:42:16,625
No need.

583
00:42:24,265 --> 00:42:26,465
I'll buy you a meal tonight.
Send me the address.

584
00:42:27,065 --> 00:42:28,065
I'll pick you up.

585
00:43:32,665 --> 00:43:33,705
Hug me tighter.

586
00:43:44,345 --> 00:43:45,265
Careful.

